  "bodyHash": "398b562fc5a70566",
  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Soft Imprints</strong> 是一個高度可配置的客戶端模組，會在單位移動到方塊上時添加動態印記</span></h2>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>功能：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>完全在客戶端運行</li>\n<li>單位在支援的方塊上行走時會留下可見的印記</li>\n<li>內建雪、雪層、沙子和紅沙的配置文件</li>\n<li>配有實時預覽的遊戲內配置界面</li>\n<li>可選的模型方式以更精準捕捉印記形狀</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>配置：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>印記檢查頻率</li>\n<li>印記外觀與渲染風格</li>\n<li>緩存與性能限制</li>\n<li>基於碰撞盒或模型的印記檢測</li>\n<li>哪些單位可以留下印記</li>\n<li>哪些方塊可以接收印記</li>\n<li>個別配置文件與整合開關</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:22px<strong>附加模組：</strong></span></h3>\n<div>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fundergarden-imprints\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/da7e66562126aff01946b27f6a3746a66254806f.png\" alt=\"Undergarden Imprints\" width=\"120\"></a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffaithful-imprints-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fab6497f3289ab41159ab68be60de7adf5dc15f6.png\" alt=\"Faithful Imprints 32x\" width=\"120\"></a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffaithful-imprints-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c8e2c3d6f202a1ddac14d2a6f2d02ab2dce2e1f.png\" alt=\"Faithful Imprints 64x\" width=\"120\"></a>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎將此模組用於整合包</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Fabric 版本需要 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Fabric API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若發現任何問題，請在本評論區或 <a href=\"https://github.com/0Templ/SoftImprints/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 進行回報</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
